  @case 'a held strand bends the harmony to it'  [pure]  @ 1097-1119
  @case 'behind a run of fixed classes the answer hangs on the hold'  [pure]  @ 1123-1129
  @case 'the C7 sounding alone crosses at a pull of 0.95'  [pure]  @ 1133-1155
